{
  "note": [
    "The Tool Room's fabric (DR-106, the mech wing), cut from the one Kalamontee layout in scripts/fabric-kalamontee.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. 5 x 3.2 x 10, the eye at the middle. The game: \"apparently a storage room for tools. Exits lead northeast and east\" (compone.zil 1519), with SHELVES; the flask \"on the floor below the lowest shelf\", the magnet \"on an upper shelf\" (1535, 1564).",
    "Open shelving the length of the west wall, its lowest board 0.45 m up; a tool cabinet in the north-west corner; a bench and a tool board on the south wall; a rack on the pier between the doorways. Both doorways, 1.6 x 2.4, are in the east wall (the wall cut once and the pier put back): north-east, 3.9 m north of the eye, onto Mech Corridor South and a slice of the Mech Corridor beyond it; east, 0.72 m south, onto the Machine Shop and, in line through its far doorway, the Robot Shop's benches 17 m off."
